flowchart TD
  Request[REST or MCP request]
  Scope{Exactly one valid collectionId?}
  Deny[Reject missing, duplicate, unknown or mismatched scope]
  Cap[Resolve request-scoped capabilities]
  Pub[public-techniques<br/>published read only]
  Cur[curated-tools<br/>published read only]
  Play[playground]
  MCP{MCP connection?}
  Read[Eight existing read tools]
  Write[Eight reads + twelve existing catalog writes]
  DB[Collection filters, immutable stamping,<br/>reference checks and database guards]
  Files[Dedicated Playground attachment storage]
  Request --> Scope
  Scope -->|no| Deny
  Scope -->|yes| Cap
  Cap --> Pub
  Cap --> Cur
  Cap --> Play
  Pub --> MCP
  Cur --> MCP
  MCP -->|published connection| Read
  Play --> MCP
  MCP -->|Playground write capability enabled| Write
  Play --> DB
  Play --> Files
